  "description": "One-line, self-hosted crash reporting and observability for .NET MAUI (Android, iOS, Mac Catalyst, Windows) — a Sentry/App Center/Crashlytics alternative for the .NET ecosystem. Crash and ANR capture, sessions and crash-free rates, app start/page load/HTTP performance, offline store-and-forward, breadcrumbs, device context, PII scrubbing and opt-in last-screen capture, all via builder.UseAvizoro(dsn).",
